  - x positions. Draw baseline horizontal grid at 3 levels, faint. Labels at left (2 ticks) with small font; maybe one label at mid and end. Use gene unit? No.
  - Draw event vertical dashed lines at starts with type color alpha .25. 
  - Build band path:
    - Iterate samples; for runs where mean != null. Use only up to full maxGen (charts not animated; all). Draw `ctx.beginPath();` upper points forward; lower reversed. Fill color with alpha .1.
